 "Two-dimensional slope stability analysis by limit equilibrium methods of slices (Ordinary, Bishop, Janbu, Corps of Engineers, Lowe-Karafiath, Spencer, Morgenstern-Price) with circular and non-circular critical surface search.\n\nThe geology layer must be drawn in section coordinates (x = distance, y = elevation) and contain the fields unit_weight (kN/m3), cohesion (kPa) and phi (degrees).": "한계평형 절편법(일반 절편법, Bishop, Janbu, Corps of Engineers, Lowe-Karafiath, Spencer, Morgenstern-Price)을 이용한 2차원 사면안정해석으로, 원호 및 비원호 임계 활동면을 탐색합니다.\n\n지질 레이어는 단면 좌표(x = 거리, y = 표고)로 작성하고 unit_weight(kN/m3), cohesion(kPa), phi(도) 필드를 포함해야 합니다.",
